        },
        {
          "text": "ndaambila mwami kuti, Mwami apone lyoonse. Sa busyu bwangu tabweelede kuba abuusu? Munzi bamataata nkubazikidwe ulisaalidwe, amilyango yawo ilipiide mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
